    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to a dystopian future where every connection can be your last.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>void future</strong>, you take on the role of a skilled hacker operating in a near-future cyberpunk world, where corporations hold more power than governments, and personal freedom is a distant memory. As part of a secret underground hacking collective, you infiltrate corporate systems, steal sensitive data, and uncover dark secrets that could change the course of history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478560/extras/5084d507613094ac97d75df019793f04.poster.avif?t=1754663885\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478560/extras/5084d507613094ac97d75df019793f04.webm?t=1754663885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478560/extras/5084d507613094ac97d75df019793f04.mp4?t=1754663885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in intense, tactical hacking missions where every line of code counts. Use your skills to breach firewalls, decrypt encrypted data, and infiltrate heavily-secured corporate networks. But be careful\u2014every action you take leaves a digital footprint, and the more you push, the more you attract attention from powerful forces.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hack &amp; Explore</strong>: Navigate through complex systems, bypassing security protocols, cracking passwords, and discovering hidden vulnerabilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve Challenges</strong>: Each mission features quick puzzles and logic tasks that push your hacking skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boost Your Arsenal</strong>: Unlock new tools to hack faster and smarter.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478560/extras/2483cfb056098f97f560f9f4ed39ebc7.poster.avif?t=1754663885\" width=450 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478560/extras/2483cfb056098f97f560f9f4ed39ebc7.webm?t=1754663885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478560/extras/2483cfb056098f97f560f9f4ed39ebc7.mp4?t=1754663885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While carrying out what should have been a routine mission, something goes wrong. Badly wrong. Suddenly, you're flagged by one of the world\u2019s most powerful corporations \u2014 and now you're a target.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the net tightens around you, survival becomes your only objective. You\u2019ll need to rely on your skills, stay invisible, and navigate a world where every move is monitored, and every connection could be a trap.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trust No One</strong>: Dive into a world of deception and lies, where nothing is as it seems.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stay in the Shadows</strong>: Use your hacking skills to avoid detection, slip past surveillance, and escape the grip of a system that wants you erased.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to a dystopian future where every connection can be your last.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>void future</strong>, you take on the role of a skilled hacker operating in a near-future cyberpunk world, where corporations hold more power than governments, and personal freedom is a distant memory. As part of a secret underground hacking collective, you infiltrate corporate systems, steal sensitive data, and uncover dark secrets that could change the course of history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478560/extras/5084d507613094ac97d75df019793f04.poster.avif?t=1754663885\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478560/extras/5084d507613094ac97d75df019793f04.webm?t=1754663885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478560/extras/5084d507613094ac97d75df019793f04.mp4?t=1754663885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in intense, tactical hacking missions where every line of code counts. Use your skills to breach firewalls, decrypt encrypted data, and infiltrate heavily-secured corporate networks. But be careful\u2014every action you take leaves a digital footprint, and the more you push, the more you attract attention from powerful forces.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hack &amp; Explore</strong>: Navigate through complex systems, bypassing security protocols, cracking passwords, and discovering hidden vulnerabilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve Challenges</strong>: Each mission features quick puzzles and logic tasks that push your hacking skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boost Your Arsenal</strong>: Unlock new tools to hack faster and smarter.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478560/extras/2483cfb056098f97f560f9f4ed39ebc7.poster.avif?t=1754663885\" width=450 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478560/extras/2483cfb056098f97f560f9f4ed39ebc7.webm?t=1754663885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478560/extras/2483cfb056098f97f560f9f4ed39ebc7.mp4?t=1754663885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While carrying out what should have been a routine mission, something goes wrong. Badly wrong. Suddenly, you're flagged by one of the world\u2019s most powerful corporations \u2014 and now you're a target.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the net tightens around you, survival becomes your only objective. You\u2019ll need to rely on your skills, stay invisible, and navigate a world where every move is monitored, and every connection could be a trap.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trust No One</strong>: Dive into a world of deception and lies, where nothing is as it seems.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stay in the Shadows</strong>: Use your hacking skills to avoid detection, slip past surveillance, and escape the grip of a system that wants you erased.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "In void future, you play as a hacker in a cyberpunk world ruled by corporations. Hack, solve puzzles, and uncover a global conspiracy. Hunted by a system that never sleeps, you\u2019ll need to stay hidden, outsmart surveillance, and fight to survive.",
